@startuml
title Observer: оповещение об изменении расписания (Вариант 8)

interface ScheduleListener {
  +onScheduleChanged(route, newTime) : void
}

class SuburbanStation {
  -listeners : List<ScheduleListener>
  +addListener(listener) : void
  +removeListener(listener) : void
  +scheduleChanged(route, newTime) : void
}

class DisplayBoard
class Journal
class Broadcast
class MobileApp

SuburbanStation o--> ScheduleListener : оповещает
ScheduleListener <|.. DisplayBoard
ScheduleListener <|.. Journal
ScheduleListener <|.. Broadcast
ScheduleListener <|.. MobileApp
@enduml
